5. Commit to `main`: `git add -A && git commit -m "feat: checkpoint N"`.
6. Mark the phase done: `rdm phase update N --status done --commit "$(git rev-parse HEAD)" --no-edit --roadmap @RDM_ROADMAP@ --project @RDM_PROJECT@`, then `rdm commit -m "chore(plan): checkpoint N done"`.

